text: ["Activated abilities of artifacts can't be activated.", 'All creatures have "At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice this creature unless you pay {1}."', 'Artifact and enchantment spells your opponents cast cost {2} more to cast.\nSacrifice Aura of Silence: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, discard X cards.\nFirestorm deals X damage to each of X targets.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, exile X creature cards from your graveyard.\nHaunting Misery deals X damage to target player or planeswalker.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a blue permanent.\nCounter target spell.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\nTarget opponent discards two cards.', 'At end of combat, destroy each creature that blocked or was blocked this turn.', "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, if that player controls a nonblack, nonland permanent, Urborg Stalker deals 1 damage to that player.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, Cinder Giant deals 2 damage to each other creature you control.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, Festering Evil deals 1 damage to each creature and each player.\n{B}{B}, Sacrifice Festering Evil: It deals 3 damage to each creature and each player.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, destroy all artifacts and enchantments. They can't be regenerated.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, mill seven cards.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Barrow Ghoul unless you exile the top creature card of your graveyard.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Peacekeeper unless you pay {1}{W}.\nCreatures can't attack.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may flip a coin. If you win the flip, put a fuse counter on Goblin Bomb. If you lose the flip, remove a fuse counter from Goblin Bomb.\nRemove five fuse counters from Goblin Bomb and sacrifice it: It deals 20 damage to target player or planeswalker.', "Banding (Any creatures with banding, and up to one without, can attack in a band. Bands are blocked as a group. If any creatures with banding you control are blocking or being blocked by a creature, you divide that creature's combat damage, not its controller, among any of the creatures it's being blocked by or is blocking.)", "Banding (Any creatures with banding, and up to one without, can attack in a band. Bands are blocked as a group. If any creatures with banding you control are blocking or being blocked by a creature, you divide that creature's combat damage, not its controller, among any of the creatures it's being blocked by or is blocking.)\nCumulative upkeep {1} (At the beginning of your upkeep, put an age counter on this permanent, then sacrifice it unless you pay its upkeep cost for each age counter on it.)", 'Bloodrock Cyclops attacks each combat if able.', "Cast this spell only during the declare blockers step.\nX target attacking creatures become blocked. Choking Vines deals 1 damage to each of those creatures. (This spell works on creatures that can't be blocked.)", 'Choose a source you control and flip a coin. If you win the flip, the next time that source would deal damage this turn, it deals double that damage instead. If you lose the flip, the next time it would deal damage this turn, prevent that damage.', 'Choose one —\n• Thunderbolt deals 3 damage to target player or planeswalker.\n• Thunderbolt deals 4 damage to target creature with flying.', 'Cone of Flame deals 1 damage to any target, 2 damage to another target, and 3 damage to a third target.', 'Counter target instant or sorcery spell unless its controller pays {1}.\nDraw a card.', "Creatures can't be the targets of spells.", 'Creatures you control have haste. (They can attack and {T} as soon as they come under your control.)', "Creatures you control have vigilance. (Attacking doesn't cause them to tap.)", "Cumulative upkeep {1} (At the beginning of your upkeep, put an age counter on this permanent, then sacrifice it unless you pay its upkeep cost for each age counter on it.)\nAt the beginning of your draw step, destroy each creature with mana value equal to the number of age counters on Wave of Terror. They can't be regenerated.", 'Cumulative upkeep {1} (At the beginning of your upkeep, put an age counter on this permanent, then sacrifice it unless you pay its upkeep cost for each age counter on it.)\nWhen Ancestral Knowledge enters the battlefield, look at the top ten cards of your library, then exile any number of them and put the rest back on top of your library in any order.\nWhen Ancestral Knowledge leaves the battlefield, shuffle your library.', 'Cumulative upkeep {1} (At the beginning of your upkeep, put an age counter on this permanent, then sacrifice it unless you pay its upkeep cost for each age counter on it.)\nWhen Revered Unicorn leaves the battlefield, you gain life equal to the number of age counters on it.', 'Cumulative upkeep {2} (At the beginning of your upkeep, put an age counter on this permanent, then sacrifice it unless you pay its upkeep cost for each age counter on it.)\nWhen Arctic Wolves enters the battlefield, draw a card.', "Cumulative upkeep {2} (At the beginning of your upkeep, put an age counter on this permanent, then sacrifice it unless you pay its upkeep cost for each age counter on it.)\nWhen a player doesn't pay Heart of Bogardan's cumulative upkeep, Heart of Bogardan deals X damage to target player or planeswalker and each creature that player or that planeswalker's controller controls, where X is twice the number of age counters on Heart of Bogardan minus 2.", "Cumulative upkeep {2} (At the beginning of your upkeep, put an age counter on this permanent, then sacrifice it unless you pay {2} for each age counter on it.)\nMwonvuli Ooze's power and toughness are each equal to 1 plus twice the number of age counters on it.", 'Cumulative upkeep {G} (At the beginning of your upkeep, put an age counter on this permanent, then sacrifice it unless you pay its upkeep cost for each age counter on it.)', 'Cumulative upkeep—Draw a card. (At the beginning of your upkeep, put an age counter on this permanent, then sacrifice it unless you pay its upkeep cost for each age counter on it.)\nAt the beginning of your end step, sacrifice a land and discard your hand.', 'Cumulative upkeep—Pay 2 life. (At the beginning of your upkeep, put an age counter on this permanent, then sacrifice it unless you pay its upkeep cost for each age counter on it.)\nPrevent all damage that would be dealt to creatures you control.', 'Cumulative upkeep—Put a -1/-1 counter on Aboroth. (At the beginning of your upkeep, put an age counter on this permanent, then sacrifice it unless you pay its upkeep cost for each age counter on it.)', 'Defender\nWhen Cinder Wall blocks, destroy it at end of combat.', "Destroy target creature that was dealt damage this turn. It can't be regenerated.", "Each creature you control can't be blocked by more than one creature.", 'Each player discards any number of cards, then draws that many cards.\nDraw a card.', 'Each player draws a card for each creature card in their graveyard.', "Each player sacrifices the creature they control with the highest mana value unless they pay that creature's mana cost. If two or more creatures a player controls are tied for highest, that player chooses one.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't be blocked by creatures with power 3 or greater.\nSacrifice Kithkin Armor: The next time a source of your choice would deal damage to enchanted creature this turn, prevent that damage.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.\nAt the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted creature's controller, that player may discard a card at random. If the player does, untap that creature.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 for each card in your hand.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1.\nSacrifice Briar Shield: Enchanted creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/-1.\nSacrifice Coils of the Medusa: Destroy all non-Wall creatures blocking enchanted creature.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has "Cumulative upkeep {1}." (At the beginning of its controller\'s upkeep, that player puts an age counter on it, then sacrifices it unless they pay its upkeep cost for each age counter on it.)', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has flying.\nSacrifice Phantom Wings: Return enchanted creature to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant creature\nSacrifice an untapped creature: Enchanted creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn.\nSacrifice enchanted creature: Creatures you control get +2/+0 until end of turn.', "Enchant creature\nWhen Abduction enters the battlefield, untap enchanted creature.\nYou control enchanted creature.\nWhen enchanted creature dies, return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control.", 'Enchant creature\n{1}, Exile the top card of your graveyard: Enchanted creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Enchant creature you control\nEnchanted creature has "{T}: This creature deals 1 damage to any target."\nSacrifice Fire Whip: Fire Whip deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Exile all cards from your library. Then shuffle your graveyard into your library.', 'Exile the top creature card of your graveyard: Necratog gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Exile the top creature card of your graveyard: Regenerate Zombie Scavengers.', "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'First strike\n{1}{W}: Tap target creature blocking Master of Arms.', 'Flanking (Whenever a creature without flanking blocks this creature, the blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.)', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\nFirst strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', 'Flying\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, Fledgling Djinn deals 1 damage to you.', 'Flying\nCloud Djinn can block only creatures with flying.', 'Flying\nCumulative upkeep—Pay 1 life. (At the beginning of your upkeep, put an age counter on this permanent, then sacrifice it unless you pay its upkeep cost for each age counter on it.)', 'Flying\nPay 1 life: Regenerate Mischievous Poltergeist.', "Flying\nPhasing (This phases in or out before you untap during each of your untap steps. While it's phased out, it's treated as though it doesn't exist.)", "Flying\nWhen Alabaster Dragon dies, shuffle it into its owner's library.", 'Flying\nWhen Mistmoon Griffin dies, exile Mistmoon Griffin, then return the top creature card of your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Flying\nWhen Sage Owl enters the battlefield, look at the top four cards of your library, then put them back in any order.', "Flying\nWhen another creature enters the battlefield, return Timid Drake to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\nYou may discard Circling Vultures any time you could cast an instant.\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Circling Vultures unless you exile the top creature card of your graveyard.', 'Flying\n{0}: Avizoa gets +2/+2 until end of turn. You skip your next untap step. Activate only once each turn.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWhen Fog Elemental attacks or blocks, sacrifice it at end of combat.", 'Flying, protection from black', 'Foriysian Brigade can block an additional creature each combat.', 'Gemstone Mine enters the battlefield with three mining counters on it.\n{T}, Remove a mining counter from Gemstone Mine: Add one mana of any color. If there are no mining counters on Gemstone Mine, sacrifice it.', 'Haste\nWhen Lava Hounds enters the battlefield, it deals 4 damage to you.', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\nWhen Thundermare enters the battlefield, tap all other creatures.', "If Lotus Vale would enter the battlefield, sacrifice two untapped lands instead. If you do, put Lotus Vale onto the battlefield. If you don't, put it into its owner's graveyard.\n{T}: Add three mana of any one color.", "If Scorched Ruins would enter the battlefield, sacrifice two untapped lands instead. If you do, put Scorched Ruins onto the battlefield. If you don't, put it into its owner's graveyard.\n{T}: Add {C}{C}{C}{C}.", 'Lava Storm deals 2 damage to each attacking creature or Lava Storm deals 2 damage to each blocking creature.', "Look at target player's hand and choose two cards from it. Put them on top of that player's library in any order.", "Manta Ray can't attack unless defending player controls an Island.\nManta Ray can't be blocked except by blue creatures.\nWhen you control no Islands, sacrifice Manta Ray.", "Maraxus of Keld's power and toughness are each equal to the number of untapped artifacts, creatures, and lands you control.", "Phantom Warrior can't be blocked.", "Phasing (This phases in or out before you untap during each of your untap steps. While it's phased out, it's treated as though it doesn't exist.)\nWhen Ertai's Familiar phases out or leaves the battlefield, mill three cards.\n{U}: Until your next upkeep, Ertai's Familiar can't phase out.", 'Prevent all damage that would be dealt to creatures.', 'Regenerate target creature. You gain control of that creature if it regenerates this way.', 'Return X target creature cards from your graveyard to your hand. You lose X life.', 'Return target artifact card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Return target artifact or enchantment card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Roc Hatchling enters the battlefield with four shell counters on it.\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, remove a shell counter from Roc Hatchling.\nAs long as Roc Hatchling has no shell counters on it, it gets +3/+2 and has flying.', 'Search your library and graveyard for five cards and exile the rest. Put the chosen cards on top of your library in any order. You lose half your life, rounded up.', 'Search your library for up to three creature cards, put them into your graveyard, then shuffle.', "Swampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)\nWhenever Odylic Wraith deals damage to a player, that player discards a card.", 'Tap an untapped creature you control: Llanowar Behemoth gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Target creature attacks this turn if able.\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature gets +1/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn.\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 and gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Target opponent sacrifices a creature for each creature put into your graveyard from the battlefield this turn.', "Target player shuffles up to three target cards from their graveyard into their library.\nDraw a card.\nWhen Gaea's Blessing is put into your graveyard from your library, shuffle your graveyard into your library.", 'Trample\nCumulative upkeep—Pay 1 life. (At the beginning of your upkeep, put an age counter on this permanent, then sacrifice it unless you pay its upkeep cost for each age counter on it.)', 'Untap all creatures you control.', "Until end of turn, target player can't cast instant or sorcery spells, and that player can't activate abilities that aren't mana abilities.\nDraw a card.", 'Vigilance', 'When Abyssal Gatekeeper dies, each player sacrifices a creature.', 'When Barishi dies, exile Barishi, then shuffle all creature cards from your graveyard into your library.', 'When Bogardan Firefiend dies, it deals 2 damage to target creature.', 'When Fallow Wurm enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you discard a land card.', 'When Harvest Wurm enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you return a basic land card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Hidden Horror enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you discard a creature card.', 'When Hurloon Shaman dies, each player sacrifices a land.', 'When Liege of the Hollows dies, each player may pay any amount of mana. Then each player creates a number of 1/1 green Squirrel creature tokens equal to the amount of mana they paid this way.', 'When Llanowar Sentinel enters the battlefield, you may pay {1}{G}. If you do, search your library for a card named Llanowar Sentinel, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'When Merfolk Traders enters the battlefield, draw a card, then discard a card.', 'When Noble Benefactor dies, each player may search their library for a card and put that card into their hand. Then each player who searched their library this way shuffles.', 'When Rogue Elephant enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you sacrifice a Forest.', 'When Striped Bears enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'When Sylvan Hierophant dies, exile Sylvan Hierophant, then return another target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Veteran Explorer dies, each player may search their library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'When an opponent casts a creature spell, sacrifice Straw Golem.', "Whenever Bone Dancer attacks and isn't blocked, you may put the top creature card of defending player's graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. If you do, Bone Dancer assigns no combat damage this turn.", 'Whenever Dwarven Berserker becomes blocked, it gets +3/+0 and gains trample until end of turn.', "Whenever Goblin Grenadiers attacks and isn't blocked, you may sacrifice it. If you do, destroy target creature and target land.", "Whenever Goblin Vandal attacks and isn't blocked, you may pay {R}. If you do, destroy target artifact defending player controls and Goblin Vandal assigns no combat damage this turn.", 'Whenever Jangling Automaton attacks, untap all creatures defending player controls.', "Whenever Ophidian attacks and isn't blocked, you may draw a card. If you do, Ophidian assigns no combat damage this turn.", 'Whenever Sawtooth Ogre blocks or becomes blocked by a creature, Sawtooth Ogre deals 1 damage to that creature at end of combat.', 'Whenever Tolarian Entrancer becomes blocked by a creature, gain control of that creature at end of combat.', "Whenever a creature dies, Dingus Staff deals 2 damage to that creature's controller.", 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield, Aether Flash deals 2 damage to it.', 'Whenever a creature is put into your graveyard from the battlefield, you may sacrifice Angelic Renewal. If you do, return that card to the battlefield.', "Whenever a creature you control attacks, it phases out at end of combat. (While it's phased out, it's treated as though it doesn't exist. It phases in before you untap during your next untap step.)", 'Whenever a land an opponent controls is tapped for mana, tap all lands that player controls that could produce any type of mana that land could produce.', "You can't cast creature spells.", 'You gain 2 life for each card in your hand.', 'You gain life equal to the number of creature cards in your graveyard.', "You may exile the top three black cards of your graveyard rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\nSpinning Darkness deals 3 damage to target nonblack creature. You gain 3 life.", '{1}, Exile the top card of your graveyard: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn.', '{1}, {T}: Target creature gains flanking until end of turn. (Whenever a creature without flanking blocks this creature, the blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.)', '{1}{G}{G}: Destroy all other enchantments.', '{1}{W}, {T}: Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt by target blocked creature this turn.', '{2}, Sacrifice a nontoken permanent: Draw a card.', '{2}: Draw a card. Any player may activate this ability but only during their draw step.', '{2}: Until end of turn, Chimeric Sphere becomes a 2/1 Construct artifact creature with flying.\n{2}: Until end of turn, Chimeric Sphere becomes a 3/2 Construct artifact creature and loses flying.', '{2}: Until end of turn, target nonartifact creature gets +1/+0 and becomes an artifact in addition to its other types.', "{2}{G}{G}: Reveal the top card of your library. If it's a creature card, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, put it into your graveyard.", '{3}, {T}: Until end of turn, you may cast instant and sorcery spells from the top of your graveyard. If a spell cast this way would be put into a graveyard, exile it instead.', '{5}, {T}: Reveal the top three cards of your library. Target opponent chooses one of those cards. Put that card into your graveyard, then draw two cards.', '{5}: Until end of turn, Xanthic Statue becomes an 8/8 Golem artifact creature with trample.', '{B}{B}, Pay 2 life, Sacrifice a Swamp: Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', '{G}, Sacrifice a Forest: Put a +2/+2 counter on Fungus Elemental. Activate only if Fungus Elemental entered the battlefield this turn.', '{G}: Target creature loses flying until end of turn.\nSacrifice Downdraft: It deals 2 damage to each creature with flying.', '{T}, Sacrifice Llanowar Druid: Untap all Forests.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Mind Stone: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{2}, {T}: You may cast creature spells this turn as though they had flash.', "{T}: Exile the bottom card of target player's graveyard.\n{1}, Sacrifice Phyrexian Furnace: Exile target card from a graveyard. Draw a card.", '{T}: Heavy Ballista deals 2 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', '{T}: Put a -1/-1 counter on Serrated Biskelion and a -1/-1 counter on target creature.', "{T}: Switch target creature's power and toughness until end of turn.", "{T}: Tap target artifact you don't control.", "{U}{U}, {T}: Target creature phases out. (While it's phased out, it's treated as though it doesn't exist. It phases in before its controller untaps during their next untap step.)", '{W}, Exile a creature card from your graveyard: You gain 1 life.', '{W}{W}, {T}: Destroy target red permanent.', '{X}{X}{R}, {T}, Sacrifice Orcish Settlers: Destroy X target lands.']
